{"id":"a404d2c25074b0b1","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-cost-function.md","title":"单调代价函数","display":"df-cost-function — 单调代价函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-cost-function","aliases":["43-df-cost-function"],"display":"df-cost-function — 单调代价函数","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"§15.1.1; §15.1.12; §15.5.3, printed pp.408,425,449–451 / PDF pp.428,445,469–471","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-cost-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-cost-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cost-function — 单调代价函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§15.1.1; §15.1.12; §15.5.3, printed pp.408,425,449–451 / PDF pp.428,445,469–471"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\">\\(c:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\)</span>；可计算谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。本节点采用含极限条件的单调代价函数约定；下式将极限条件展开为对所有阶段一致的有理尾界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CostFunction}(c)\\iff\\mathrm{Computable}(c)\\land\\left(\\forall x,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;[c(x+1,s)\\le c(x,s)\\land c(x,s)\\le c(x,s+1)]\\right)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\ge N\\Rightarrow c(x,s)\\le2^{-k}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CostFunction}(c)\\iff\\mathrm{Computable}(c)\\land\\left(\\forall x,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;[c(x+1,s)\\le c(x,s)\\land c(x,s)\\le c(x,s+1)]\\right)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\ge N\\Rightarrow c(x,s)\\le2^{-k}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把本书尾和构造中复用的条件抽成定义。逐界尾条件等价于原来的零极限要求，并对不收敛或阶段上确界无穷的候选直接给出真假值。这里不加入 x≥s 时 c(x,s)=0 的可选阶段规范；该规范与所列单调性相容，本目录的标准尾和代价 c_K 本身也满足它。</p>\n<p>本次仅核查形式化的内部一致性，未重新核对原书陈述或完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$c:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}$；可计算谓词见 [[43-df-computable]]。本节点采用含极限条件的单调代价函数约定；下式将极限条件展开为对所有阶段一致的有理尾界。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"c:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CostFunction}(c)\\iff\\mathrm{Computable}(c)\\land\\left(\\forall x,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;[c(x+1,s)\\le c(x,s)\\land c(x,s)\\le c(x,s+1)]\\right)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\ge N\\Rightarrow c(x,s)\\le2^{-k}).","display":true}],"bytes":1614,"backlinks":[{"id":"ad966749904b15ec","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$c:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}$；$\\mathrm{CostFunction}$ 见 [[43-df-cost-function]]；$a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是下式量化的全函数；$\\operatorname{Approx}(a,A)$ 采用 [[43-df-computable-approximation]] 中可计算且逐输入最终稳定于 $A$ 的正式定义。下式为每个 $a$ 构造仅在变化阶段定义的 $m_a$；费用级数在 $[0,+\\infty]$ 中取非负级数和。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-343","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-cost-function]] — 单调代价函数"}],"outgoing":["f357216a7edb035a"]}